findings.comment:
750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) 4 door freezer - bottom inside, gaskets, & hinges (food crumbs);
B) fryers - general surfaces (grease);
C) prep cooler - bottom inside & drawer gaskets/seals (food debris/buildup);
D) nut portion storage bins on cook line (food debris in bottom);  and
E) lobby soda machine - waste bin (mold).

Clean general surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) dry storage shelving with caramel and nut portions (dust buildup);
B) top of dish machine around door seals (grease/food debris);
C) walkin cooler - 1. fan covers (dust) & 2. metal rolling racks (mold);
D) 4 door freezer - gaskets, hinges, and bottom inside  (food crumb accumulation);  and
E) fryers - underside & crevices between (grease accumulation).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
